# A rare candy out of the bag, a level, and the evolution that follows it.
#
# Caterpie evolves at level 7 and this one is level 6, so the candy is what
# makes the question worth asking; the run uses it through the game's own
# item-effect call and then asks Pokemon_GetEvolutionTargetSpecies the same
# thing the party menu asks after a level-up item.

name CANDY
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20301
money 3000
party SPECIES_CATERPIE 6 ITEM_NONE
item ITEM_RARE_CANDY 1
map MAP_HEADER_SOLACEON_TOWN 0x236 0x291 FACE_DOWN
